{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧第一段的大号白字和红色强调词，尤其是“不再藏着喜欢”“我不再为它道歉”；随后容易注意到第二段的黄色强调词。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他不再隐藏自己对对方的喜欢，开始坦然面对这份感情；但彼此需要、关系目前处于什么状态，不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"高兴、释然、坦然，带有一点心痛。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他意识到自己需要对方、对方有时也需要他；此前悬置的期待似乎得到满足；但对方以后是否还愿意让他陪伴，并不是他能决定的。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"第一、第二、第三段都有较大的醒目文字，红、黄、灰三种强调区域争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：第一段讲彼此需要和不再隐藏喜欢，第二段讲高兴与接纳，第三段讲未来亲近的不确定及欢喜中的心痛，需要拼接才能理解完整关系。\",\n    \"第一段和第三段单块都较长，包含好几层意思，不能只靠放大的强调词直接获得完整处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b66f9dbb-f133-4c24-a77f-57e2494ec1d2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011544298781Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:16:23.171639+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a65470c14a61ed94969d567cf0904c2945af17db4393ed8c38adc58636062a5f", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1e